{"about_the_game":"Dandy &amp; Randy DX Description:<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651030/extras/3041458d0bd9ba99790c143457fdf8c9.poster.avif?t=1741873373\" width=614 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651030/extras/3041458d0bd9ba99790c143457fdf8c9.webm?t=1741873373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651030/extras/3041458d0bd9ba99790c143457fdf8c9.mp4?t=1741873373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Dandy and Randy</strong> are a couple of archaeologists who are in a huge pickle. They owe a ton of money to their bank and unless they can't figure out a way to pay it back, they're done for! Luckily, they have just received the information about a mysterious, fabled precious stone showing up in a far away island.<br><br>Can they find it, pay back their debts and become rich in the process? It's up to you to find out!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651030/extras/f44668929bf37ec2a9adc3bff0004b8a.gif?t=1741873373\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651030/extras/f44668929bf37ec2a9adc3bff0004b8a.poster.avif?t=1741873373\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><br><br>Play either alone or with a friend! With local co-op anyone can join in the fun at any time during the game. You can even unlock new characters as you play!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651030/extras/35c83dff9e8d74b75fa80a995fb5894e.poster.avif?t=1741873373\" width=614 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651030/extras/35c83dff9e8d74b75fa80a995fb5894e.webm?t=1741873373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651030/extras/35c83dff9e8d74b75fa80a995fb5894e.mp4?t=1741873373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Dandy &amp; Randy DX Features: <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Travel across the land in both single-player or local multiplayer co-op.<br></li><li>Fight a diverse cast of enemies.<br></li><li>Discover tons of treasures, hidden or not.<br></li><li>Solve puzzles and feel smart about it!<br></li><li>Unlockable characters!<br></li><li>A shop system with encouraging help!<br></li><li>Cute art style for all ages! Try playing with your grandma.<br></li><li>Steam Achievements</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651030/extras/baa8ab4124eade24d5766de6d91e8b37.poster.avif?t=1741873373\" width=614 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651030/extras/baa8ab4124eade24d5766de6d91e8b37.webm?t=1741873373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651030/extras/baa8ab4124eade24d5766de6d91e8b37.mp4?t=1741873373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Lime Forest Clear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1651030/00bac21ee553ac3085be6756523d22c8e557f70f.jpg"},{"name":"Mango Desert Clear!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1651030/afc8eb1a684daab0791614586b0cafdac5697773.jpg"},{"name":"Dusk Woods Clear!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1651030/445b1e723f0821b4621c20ae5cb6c0402d4fd350.jpg"},{"name":"Amber Mines Clear!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/ste